ments/srd036-mktemp.yaml** (read, not to be modified)\n     - Contains all requirements R1-R4 for mktemp\n     - R4.3 specifies test coverage areas: default file creation, -d, custom template, --suffix, -p, -t, -u, error cases\n     - R4.4 specifies tests must NOT compare exact filenames due to random components\n     - Non-goals: no lifecycle management, no multiple files per invocation, no stdin templates\n   \n   - **cmd/mktemp/main.go** (read, to be modified)\n     - Currently 265 lines implementing R1.1-R1.5, R2.1-R2.3, R3.1-R3.6\n     - Key structures:\n       ```go\n       type options struct {\n           directory bool\n           parentDir string\n           useTmpdir bool\n           suffix    string\n           dryRun    bool\n           quiet     bool\n       }\n       ```\n     - Functions: main(), parseArgs(), parseLongFlag(), parseShortFlags(), run(), resolveTemplate(), entityKind(), countTrailingX(), randomString(), unwrapErr()\n     - Uses crypto/rand for random name generation with charset \"ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZabcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz0123456789\"\n     - Default template: \"tmp.XXXXXXXXXX\"\n     - File creation: 0600 permissions; Directory creation: 0700 permissions\n     - 100-retry loop for name collisions\n     - Quiet mode suppresses error messages using sentinel errQuiet\n   \n   - **cmd/mktemp/mktemp_test.go** (exists in repo but NOT yet read)\n     - Listed in repository_files, needs to be read to understand existing test coverage\n     - This is where R4.3 and R4.4 test implementations likely need to go\n\n4. Errors and fixes:\n   - No errors encountered yet. Only two file reads were completed before the summary was requested.\n\n5. Problem Solving:\n   - Read SRD to understand exact requirements for R4.3 and R4.4\n   - Read existing main.go to understand current implementation state\n   - Have not yet read the test file or begun implementation\n\n6. All user messages:\n   - Message 1: The massive task prompt from cobbler orchest